<p>On using Ghost Walk - Return, you create a portal that summons <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> spirits around you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns. The spirits do very little damage, but taunt all enemies in radius 3 into attacking them.</p>